Show what a completed run concluded

Usage: mjutest report [OPTIONS] [RUN]

Arguments:
  [RUN]
          The run to show. The latest by default

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>
          How to write it

          Possible values:
          - lines: The record stream
          - json:  The canonical document, exactly as the run wrote it
          
          [default: lines]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
